resource:Airbus m4i:inProject holy:ZEROe;
                a owl:NamedIndividual,
                  holy:ManufacturingOrganization;
                rdfs:comment "Airbus SE is a European multinational aerospace corporation. Airbus designs, manufactures and sells civil and military aerospace products worldwide and manufactures aircraft in Europe and various countries outside Europe. The company has three divisions: Commercial Aircraft (Airbus S.A.S.), Defence and Space, and Helicopters, the third being the largest in its industry in terms of revenues and turbine helicopter deliveries."@en;
                rdfs:label "Airbus"@en.
