holy:HydrogenProduct a owl:Class;
                     rdfs:comment "Concerning the scope of focusing on fuel cells and more precisely on PEMFCs, the sub-class reconversion will be the most focused class. Transportation, Storage and Conversion subclasses would receive greater attention when shifting the ontology to other areas of the hydrogen value chain."@en;
                     rdfs:label "Hydrogen Product"@en;
